{"id":"15ef78b25d5206a3","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison.md","title":"Boxed Ordinal Comparison in GLB","display":"lem-glb-ordinal-comparison — Boxed Ordinal Comparison in GLB","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison","aliases":["89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison"],"display":"lem-glb-ordinal-comparison — Boxed Ordinal Comparison in GLB","depends_on":["[[89-df-glb-logic]]","[[89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas]]","[[89-lem-glb-box-absorption]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-glb-ordinal-comparison — Boxed Ordinal Comparison in GLB"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8de2ffea9eb2c928\" href=\"?note=8de2ffea9eb2c928\" title=\"89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas\">89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab1164e8495d4ee1\" href=\"?note=ab1164e8495d4ee1\" title=\"89-lem-glb-box-absorption\">89-lem-glb-box-absorption</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a> 的双模态定理集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span>；序数码顺序由有限字典序定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glb\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}comparison}\\vdash\n\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\Longrightarrow\n(\\Box_0D_\\alpha\\to D_\\beta)\\in\\mathrm{GLB}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glb\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}comparison}\\vdash\n\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\Longrightarrow\n(\\Box_0D_\\alpha\\to D_\\beta)\\in\\mathrm{GLB}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 16 章 p.214，Lemma 4 及其前置反例。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>原书 Lemma 4 的证明对目标码作良序归纳。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\beta^-\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\beta^-\\)</span>，先到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\beta^-}\">\\(D_{\\beta^-}\\)</span>，再由必然化及 4 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_0D_{\\beta^-}\\to D_\\beta\">\\(\\Box_0D_{\\beta^-}\\to D_\\beta\\)</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta^-\\le\\alpha&lt;\\beta\">\\(\\beta^-\\le\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\)</span> 情形，把两码公共前缀后的剩余尾项展开；首个严格小的指数利用盒吸收引理逐次抬至 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\beta\">\\(d\\beta\\)</span>。原书 p.214 给出该尾项归纳的完整演算，本条保留其来源支持的引理接口。</p>\n<p><strong>不能删掉前件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_0\">\\(\\Box_0\\)</span>。</strong> 事实上 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\langle1\\rangle}\\equiv\\Box_1\\bot\">\\(D_{\\langle1\\rangle}\\equiv\\Box_1\\bot\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\langle1,0\\rangle}\\equiv\\Box_0\\Box_1\\bot\">\\(D_{\\langle1,0\\rangle}\\equiv\\Box_0\\Box_1\\bot\\)</span> 在 GLB 中互不蕴含（原书 p.214）。因此普通序数大小并不把全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\alpha\">\\(D_\\alpha\\)</span> 排成单调蕴含链。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\alpha\\to H_\\beta\">\\(H_\\alpha\\to H_\\beta\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\le\\beta\">\\(\\alpha\\le\\beta\\)</span> 成立：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\beta\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\)</span> 时对本引理必然化并用第一盒 4。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas","status":"resolved","id":"8de2ffea9eb2c928","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-glb-box-absorption","status":"resolved","id":"ab1164e8495d4ee1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-glb-box-absorption]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}$ 为 [[89-df-glb-logic]] 的双模态定理集。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glb\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}comparison}\\vdash\n\\alpha<\\beta\\Longrightarrow\n(\\Box_0D_\\alpha\\to D_\\beta)\\in\\mathrm{GLB}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha<\\beta^-","display":false},{"tex":"D_{\\beta^-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_0D_{\\beta^-}\\to D_\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta^-\\le\\alpha<\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"d\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_0","display":false},{"tex":"D_{\\langle1\\rangle}\\equiv\\Box_1\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"D_{\\langle1,0\\rangle}\\equiv\\Box_0\\Box_1\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\alpha\\to H_\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\le\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha<\\beta","display":false}],"bytes":1741,"backlinks":[{"id":"6e228478af514c07","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"34a172f6f4cae8dd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-171","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"序数与公式：[[89-df-small-ordinal-code]] → [[89-lem-small-ordinal-operations]] → [[89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas]] → [[89-lem-glb-box-absorption]] → [[89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison]] → [[89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation]]。"}],"outgoing":["5a9efa2261b8f73c","8de2ffea9eb2c928","ab1164e8495d4ee1"]}